                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the latency target for voice AI?</h3>
                                        <p>Under 800ms end-to-end for natural conversation. Above 1.5s feels awkward. Achieving sub-800ms takes deliberate engineering.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does voice AI cost per minute?</h3>
                                        <p>$0.05-0.30/minute typical, depending on TTS quality (ElevenLabs is premium), LLM choice, and telephony provider.</p>
                                        <h3>Which STT is best in 2026?</h3>
                                        <p>Deepgram for low-latency English, Whisper (or fine-tuned variants) for multi-language, AssemblyAI for accuracy on domain-specific terms.</p>
                                        <h3>Can voice AI handle Indian regional languages?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes, for basic flows in most major regional languages. Nuanced flows still work best in Hindi + English blend.</p>
